This Terraform configuration creates a VPC, two private subnets, an RDS instance, an IAM instance profile, an IAM role, and an Elastic Beanstalk environment linked to the RDS instance. The RDS instance is placed within the private subnets and the Elastic Beanstalk environment uses the IAM role for EC2 instances. The RDS instance credentials are set as environment variables in the Elastic Beanstalk environment. The configuration is deployable with Terraform ~> 1.9.8 and hashicorp/aws ~> 5.75.

