This Terraform HCL program creates an AWS VPC, two RDS subnets, an RDS DB instance, an RDS snapshot, an IAM role, an IAM instance profile, and two Elastic Beanstalk environments. It also creates a security group for the RDS instance and a DB subnet group for the RDS instance. The RDS DB instance is associated with the Elastic Beanstalk environments. The RDS snapshot is taken before the deployment of the Elastic Beanstalk environments. The configuration is deployable with Terraform ~> 1.9.8 and hashicorp/aws ~> 5.75.

