This Terraform configuration creates an Elastic Beanstalk application, a new version of the application running Go, an Elastic Beanstalk environment for the application, an IAM role for the Elastic Beanstalk service, an IAM instance profile for the role, and attaches Elastic Beanstalk policies to the role. The application version is stored in an S3 bucket with a realistic offline-valid name. The Elastic Beanstalk environment URL is outputted for easy access.

