This Terraform HCL program creates a VPC, two private subnets, a security group, two IAM roles, a Kinesis Firehose delivery stream, and an Elasticsearch domain with a VPC. The Elasticsearch domain is configured to receive data from the Kinesis Firehose delivery stream and publish logs to CloudWatch. The log group for the Kinesis Firehose delivery stream is also created. The configuration is deployable with Terraform ~> 1.9.8 and hashicorp/aws ~> 5.75.

