This Terraform script creates an EKS cluster with the name "example-eks-cluster" and adds the "vpc-cni" addon to it. The script also creates an IAM role for the EKS cluster and sets the VPC configuration for the cluster. The VPC subnet ID used in the example should be replaced with your actual VPC subnet ID.

