This Terraform HCL program creates an IAM role for the Lambda alias, a Lambda function, and a Lambda alias for the given function. It also sets up a permission for the Lambda alias to invoke the Lambda function. The IAM role for the Lambda alias is not attached to the Lambda alias in this example, as it cannot be done with Terraform. Instead, it should be done manually or using CloudFormation.

