This Terraform HCL program creates a VPC, two subnets (public and private), an IAM role and instance profile for EC2 instances, an EC2 Fleet launch template with a mix of On-Demand and Spot instances, and an Auto Scaling Group based on the launch template. The configuration is deployable with Terraform ~> 1.9.8 and hashicorp/aws ~> 5.75.

