This Terraform HCL program creates a VPC, subnet, and security group for the MSK cluster in the us-east-1 region. It then creates the MSK cluster with 3 broker nodes, using the specified security group and subnet. The broker nodes are launched as instances of type `m5.large`. The configuration information for the MSK cluster is set to use the default revision (1). The timeouts for creating, updating, and deleting the resources are set to 30 minutes.

