This Terraform configuration creates a managed MSK cluster with 3 broker nodes in the us-east2 region. It also creates a VPC, subnet, security group, MSK configuration, and KMS key for the MSK cluster. The configuration uses default values for variables and follows the schema summary for the AWS provider.

