This Terraform HCL configuration creates an S3 bucket to store students' code, an AWS CodeBuild project to run the code and generate results, an IAM role for CodeBuild, and an IAM policy attachment to provide necessary permissions. The configuration is deployable with Terraform ~> 1.9.8 and hashicorp/aws ~> 5.75. The S3 bucket name is synthetically generated but offline-valid, and the GitHub repository location should be replaced with the actual repository URL.

