This Terraform configuration creates a VPC, two subnets, an internet gateway, a route table, a security group, and an AWS CodeBuild project for an autograder. The security group is configured to prevent students' code from reaching the internet. The CodeBuild project is set up to run from a GitHub repository and is isolated within the VPC and subnet. An IAM role and policy are created for the CodeBuild project to allow it to interact with AWS CodeBuild services.

