This Terraform configuration creates a VPC, a subnet, an Internet Gateway, a route table, and a security group for the autograder. It also creates an S3 bucket and a CodeBuild project for running the autograder. The security group rules are configured to prevent internet access for the students' code. The CodeBuild project uses the specified S3 bucket as its source and runs within the created VPC and subnet. An IAM role is created for the CodeBuild project to allow it to assume the necessary permissions.

