This Terraform HCL program creates an AWS Lambda function, an IAM role for the Lambda function, an EventBridge rule, and an EventBridge event target. It also attaches the necessary permissions for the Lambda function to be invoked by EventBridge. The schedule expression for the EventBridge rule is set to run the Lambda function daily at 7 UTC. The Lambda function's filename, handler, and runtime are set as specified in the prompt. The IAM role for the Lambda function is created with the necessary permissions to read from CloudTrail events. The provider configuration is set to use the us-west-2 region.

