This Terraform HCL configuration creates an AWS CloudFront distribution, an AWS Route53 zone, two AWS Route53 records, and a CloudFront origin access control resource as specified in the prompt. The S3 bucket for video content is also created. The configuration is deployable with Terraform ~> 1.9.8 and hashicorp/aws ~> 5.75.

