This Terraform HCL program creates an AWS RDS option group named "option-group-pike" with major engine version 11, using the sqlserver-ee engine. It also includes options for "SQLSERVER_AUDIT" and "TDE". The SQLSERVER_AUDIT option includes the IAM_ROLE_ARN and S3_BUCKET_ARN variables. An IAM role is created for the RDS SQLSERVER_AUDIT option, and it is attached to the RDS Data Full Access policy. The IAM role ARN and S3 bucket ARN are provided as default values in case they are not known at the time of deployment.

