This Terraform HCL program creates an S3 Glacier vault with a specified access policy. It includes an IAM role for the Glacier service to assume, an S3 bucket for the vault, and necessary configurations for server-side encryption, versioning, public access blocking, lifecycle management, and access control. The access policy allows the specified IAM role to put and get objects in the S3 bucket.

