This Terraform configuration creates an Application Load Balancer, a target group, a listener, and an IAM role for the ECS service. The Application Load Balancer depends on the target group and listener, and the target group depends on the listener. The configuration also includes a variable for the VPC ID, security group ID, and task definition. Additionally, it creates a VPC and a security group as the VPC ID and security group ID are not provided in the prompt.

