This Terraform script creates an Application Load Balancer (ALB) with a target group and listener. It also creates an IAM role for the ALB and attaches the AmazonEC2FullAccess policy to it. The ALB security group ID should be replaced with the appropriate value. The script uses data sources to retrieve the default VPC and private subnets.

