This code creates an Application Load Balancer with a default action that redirects all traffic from port 80 to port 443 using HTTPS. It also creates a second listener for port 443 that forwards traffic to the target group. The resources are named according to the JSON structure provided. The `aws_security_group`, `data.aws_subnets`, and `data.aws_vpc` resources are included to ensure a valid configuration. The `aws_alb_listener_redirect` resource is not available in the AWS provider schema, so it is replaced with a forwarding action for port 443.

