This Terraform HCL program creates an Application Load Balancer (ALB) with a fixed-response action. It also creates an IAM role, IAM policy, and IAM policy attachment for the ALB to ensure it has the necessary permissions. The ALB is created in the `us-west-2` region and uses the default VPC and subnets. The security group associated with the ALB is the default one. The fixed-response action returns a "Hello, World!" message with a status code of 200.

