This Terraform HCL program creates an Application Load Balancer (ALB) with Cognito authentication. It assumes you have a Cognito user pool and identity pool already set up. The VPC, subnets, and security group are created as prerequisites. The ALB is configured to authenticate users using the specified Cognito user pool and client. The IAM role and policy are created to allow the ALB to call AWS services on behalf of the authenticated users.

