This Terraform configuration creates an Application Load Balancer (ALB) with an Authenticate-OIDC action. It also creates an IAM role for the ALB, an OpenID Connect provider, and an IAM policy attachment for AmazonEC2FullAccess. The ALB is configured to use the specified private subnets and security group. The web server instance is launched in one of the private subnets and associated with the ALB target group. The OIDC provider URL and the private subnets are placeholders that should be replaced with the appropriate values for your environment.

