This Terraform configuration creates a Gateway Load Balancer with an associated target group, listener, and IAM role with AmazonEC2FullAccess policy. The configuration assumes the existence of data sources for VPC, subnets, and security groups. The VPC, subnets, and security group names are assumed to be "main", "private", and "alb-sg", respectively. These names are realistic offline-valid defaults, but you should replace them with your actual values.

