This configuration creates an Application Load Balancer and a target group associated with it. The load balancer listens on port 80 for HTTP traffic and forwards requests to the target group. The VPC ID for the target group is assumed to be `your_existing_vpc_id`, which should be replaced with the actual VPC ID. The security group and S3 bucket are created if they don't exist, and the subnets are fetched from the data source based on the provided VPC ID.

