This Terraform configuration creates an Application Load Balancer with a Lambda Target Group and an IAM role and policy for the Lambda function to execute with ALB permissions. It also creates security groups for the ALB and Lambda, and an S3 bucket for ALB access logs. The Lambda function is defined with a simple Node.js 14.x runtime, an environment variable, and a VPC configuration.

