This configuration creates an Application Load Balancer (ALB) and an ALB Target Group. The ALB is associated with the Target Group, and a security group is created to allow traffic to the ALB. The configuration uses a custom VPC and subnets. The security group allows both incoming and outgoing traffic from any IP address (0.0.0.0/0) for simplicity. The configuration includes tags for better resource organization and identification.

