This Terraform configuration creates an RDS instance from a snapshot. It includes an IAM role for Terraform to manage RDS resources, an RDS snapshot of the source instance, and an RDS instance using the snapshot as its source. The configuration also creates a security group and an instance profile for the RDS instance. The provider is set to AWS and the region is us-west-2. The VPC is created in Terraform as a default VPC with a CIDR block of 10.0.0.0/16.

