This Terraform HCL program creates a VPC, subnet, security group, RDS DB subnet group, RDS cluster parameter group, RDS cluster, RDS cluster instance, and RDS instance. It also sets up the required dependencies between the resources. The RDS cluster instance is added as a read replica to the RDS cluster, and the RDS instance is created after the RDS cluster instance is set up. The RDS instance uses the IO1 storage type.

