This Terraform configuration creates an RDS instance restored from an S3 backup. It includes an S3 bucket for storing RDS backups, an IAM role for RDS to access the S3 bucket, and a security group and IAM policy to allow access to the RDS instance and S3 bucket from the specified VPC. The RDS instance is created using a DB snapshot from the latest backup in the S3 bucket. The VPC is created with a CIDR block of 10.0.0.0/16, which is a common and valid CIDR block for a VPC.

